                "loc": "2CH.28.1+2CH.28.2+2CH.28.3+2CH.28.4+2CH.28.5+2CH.28.6+2CH.28.7+2CH.28.8+2CH.28.9+2CH.28.10+2CH.28.11+2CH.28.12+2CH.28.13+2CH.28.14+2CH.28.15+2CH.28.16+2CH.28.17+2CH.28.18+2CH.28.19+2CH.28.20+2CH.28.21+2CH.28.22+2CH.28.23+2CH.28.24+2CH.28.25+2CH.28.26+2CH.28.27"
